{"id":"chatcmpl-6acd35610205ab585d52a585","object":"chat.completion","created":1791833442,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"**شَرْط** (sharṭ) — *condition, stipulation, prerequisite*\n\n- **Meaning:** A condition or requirement that must be fulfilled for something else to happen or be valid.\n- **Root:** ش-ر-ط\n- **Plural:** شُروط (shurūṭ)\n\n**Examples:**\n- بِشَرْطِ أنَّ… — \"on the condition that…\"\n- شُروط العَقْد — \"the terms of the contract\"\n- النَّجاح شَرْطُهُ الاجتِهاد — \"Success requires diligence.\"\n\n**Grammar note:** As a conditional particle (أداة شرط), e.g., مَنْ يَجتَهِدْ يَنجَحْ — \"whoever works hard succeeds.\"","reasoning_content":"شَرْط means \"condition/stipulation\". Render: condition."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":152,"completion_tokens":211,"total_tokens":363,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":16},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cache_write_tokens":0}}}